{
  "source": {
    "uuidList": "info-BIMJ29R_.js `uuIdMap` array (11 uuids) — the keyboard SDK supported-uuid set; verified live at hub.aulacn.com via pinia store 'aula' -> st.deviceInstance.Info_Class.uuIdMap",
    "uuidNames": "version-DcP9tp_c.js `switch(deviceId)` — obfuscator.io base64 string table decoded locally (rotation=13, index offset 0x75); cross-checked with T6() in index-ittJ_Bat.js, getBaseInfo() in info-BIMJ29R_.js and live st.deviceInfo",
    "catalog": "index-ittJ_Bat.js static model arrays M6,k6,L6,R6,Z6,F6,N6,_6,O6,U6,G6,W6,j6,V6 (obfuscator.io string table decoded locally: rotation=246, index offset 0x1cb) — the frontend's model/descriptor table: pName,pId,vId,wireless,deviceType,usage,usagePage,supportAcc,layoutClass",
    "layoutClassNote": "`layoutClass` is the device-class loader object variable name (e.g. o1 = the 68-key HE keyboard class), NOT a key-layout id",
    "keyboardMapNote": "keyboardMap (181 entries, data/keyboard_map.json) is global to the SDK and shared by all models",
    "liveRead": "hub.aulacn.com read-only via kimi-webbridge, session 'aula-reverse'",
    "unresolvedNote": "uuIdMap 的 11 个 uuid 中, 0x110000000005 / 0x11000000000f / 0x110000000016 在前端所有 chunk 中都没有名称或机型映射 (仅出现在 uuIdMap 列表; 0x11000000000f 另出现在 sdkPage 的功能门控里)。",
    "catalogRefNote": "catalogRef.index 指向本文件顶层 catalog 数组的下标"
  },
